  "typical_application": "Drive the data and shift clock from an MCU (or hardware SPI MOSI/SCK), pulse the latch (STCP) after 8 bits to update outputs. Chain Q7S into the next chip's DS to expand to 16/24/... outputs.",
  "gotchas": [
    "two separate clocks: SHCP shifts, STCP latches; forgetting to pulse the latch leaves outputs unchanged",
    "tie MR (pin 10) high and OE (pin 13) low for normal always-on operation",
    "total output current is limited; do not drive 8 LEDs at full brightness without current limiting and package power budget in mind",
    "HC inputs need near-rail logic levels; use HCT (74HCT595) when driven by 5V TTL or a 3.3V MCU into 5V"
